        {
          "text": "Tolim Aburaam tama, “Nyiingo kare Ekapolon, kimiekinae eruorik akiruorikinet naga bon. Ani bo keyakasi ngitomon neni?” Tatachu Ekapolon Akuj tama, “Nyenyasuni ayong karukau ngitomon kaneni.” ",
